{"task_id": "HumanEval/47", "solution": "def median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\n    >>> median([3, 1, 2, 4, 5])\n    3\n    >>> median([-10, 4, 6, 1000, 10, 20])\n    15.0\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_l = sorted(l)\n    n = len(sorted_l)\n    \n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        # Odd number of elements, return the middle element\n        return sorted_l[n // 2]\n    else:\n        # Even number of elements, return the average of the two middle elements\n        mid1 = sorted_l[n // 2 - 1]\n        mid2 = sorted_l[n // 2]\n        return (mid1 + mid2) / 2"}
